 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 516529,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "What is the total if 18% of the total is 45?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The formula relating the total (base), the percent in decimal form, and the part (amount) is</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"part = percent \\times total\"></span>.</p>\n<p>45 is 18% of the total.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"45 = 0.18 \\times total\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{45}}{{0.18}} = \\frac{{\\cancel{{.0.18}} \\times total}}{{\\cancel{{0.18}}}}\"></span></p>\n<p>The total is 250.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "250"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 516530,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "What is the total if 15% of the total is 900?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The formula relating the total (base), the percent in decimal form, and the part (amount) is</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"part = percent \\times total\"></span>.</p>\n<p>900 is 15% of the total.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"900 = 0.15 \\times total\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{900}}{{0.15}} = \\frac{{\\cancel{{.0.15}} \\times total}}{{\\cancel{{0.15}}}}\"></span></p>\n<p>The total is 6,000.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "6,000"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
